.UPDATE...
Issued at 931 AM PDT Sat Aug 15 2026

No significant changes to the ongoing forecast. Drizzle was most
pronounced in and around the San Francisco Bay Area this morning and
less so around the Central Coast. As such, overnight and into this
morning, reports of 0.01" to 0.06" were measured with ongoing
drizzle anticipated to end around 10 AM or 11 AM this morning. Have
also warmed temperatures by a few degrees for this afternoon as we
expect an earlier retreat of stratus to the coastline giving way to
mostly sunny skies across the inland areas this afternoon.

